4,Atakapa language explained,https://everything.explained.today/Atakapa_language/,"Atakapa exhibits strict subject-object-verb word order. While verbs are typically found in sentence-final position, it is common for adjuncts, or even subordinate clauses, to follow the verb of the principal clause.",Atakapa,Language isolate
